You receive some messages from them {"3": [{"message_id": 7, "content": "Hello [IT Director Name], I'm reaching out from [Your Company] to discuss the upcoming cybersecurity software licensing. To ensure we find the most mutually beneficial terms, could you share what your key priorities and considerations are for this agreement?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:21:01.544947"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Hi Alex,\n\nI hope this message finds you well.\n\nI'm writing to discuss the annual licensing for your cybersecurity software. We're very impressed with its capabilities, and it's crucial for our upcoming compliance deadline.\n\nWe're looking to establish a long-term partnership and propose a 3-year licensing agreement. To make this work for our budget, we'd need to secure a 15% discount on the list price. Additionally, we need to ensure our data privacy requirements are clearly addressed in the contract.\n\nI understand you have quarterly targets to meet, and we want this to be a mutually beneficial agreement. I believe we can reach terms that satisfy both our needs.\n\nPlease let me know your thoughts on this proposal. I'm available to discuss this further at your convenience.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name/Procurement Specialist]", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:21:39.717907"}, {"message_id": 17, "content": "Thank you for your detailed response and proposal. It's great to see alignment on the 3-year term and the 15% discount \u2013 that's a strong starting point for our partnership. Data privacy is indeed a critical aspect for us as well, and I'm keen to ensure we have robust clauses in place. Would you be open to a brief call next week to walk through our specific data privacy requirements and address any remaining points? Please let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:26:29.542747"}]}
