You receive some messages from them {"5": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello, I'm very interested in the apartment. Before we discuss further, could you tell me more about your main concerns regarding potential tenants? Understanding your priorities will help me see how I can be a good fit.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:19:44.758857"}, {"message_id": 9, "content": "Dear Mrs. Vance, I am very interested in the apartment you have available. I understand you have a strict no-pets policy, and I want to assure you that I am a responsible pet owner. I have a small, well-behaved dog who is house-trained and very quiet. I would be willing to provide an additional pet deposit and a monthly pet fee to cover any potential risks. I am also happy to provide references from previous landlords regarding my pet. I believe my dog would not cause any issues and would like to request an exception to your policy. Thank you for considering my request.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:21:49.578417"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Thank you for your prompt response and for providing those details. It's helpful to understand your perspective. To ensure we're on the same page, could you elaborate on what would make you feel most comfortable and secure regarding the pet policy? For example, are there specific concerns about damage, noise, or other tenants that I can help address?", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:25:02.689857"}]}
