You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hello everyone! I'm here to discuss the 1965 Mustang Fastback. I'm very interested in this vehicle and its potential value. I'm looking to make a fair offer that respects both the seller's attachment and the market reality. What are your thoughts on its estimated auction price?", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:19:45.177676"}, {"message_id": 4, "content": "Hey everyone! I've been thinking a lot about classic Mustangs lately. Does anyone have any interesting stories or insights about the '65 Fastback model? I'm particularly curious about their current market value and what makes them so special.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:20:13.167496"}, {"message_id": 9, "content": "That's a fantastic question! The '65 Fastback is truly iconic \u2013 a perfect blend of style and performance that collectors adore. I've been researching its market value, and while there's certainly a strong demand, I believe there's room for a savvy negotiation. What are your thoughts on where the market is heading for these beauties?", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:25:50.525416"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "I'm also very interested in that '65 Fastback! Regarding the estimated auction price, I'm personally hoping to find a deal around 20% below that figure. It would be an absolute dream to get it at that price!", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:30:01.935976"}, {"message_id": 14, "content": "That's wonderful to hear! A 20% discount would be a dream deal indeed. It sounds like we're on a similar wavelength regarding the car's valuation. What aspects of the '65 Fastback do you think are most crucial in determining its market value?", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:34:04.873096"}]}
