", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:27:19.441327"}, {"message_id": 21, "content": "Thank you for clarifying your priorities \u2013 the 3-year term, 15% discount, and data privacy clauses are duly noted. These are significant points, and we are certainly willing to explore how we can accommodate them to support your compliance efforts and build a strong, long-term partnership.\n\nTo help us finalize the best possible offer, could we schedule a brief call to discuss the specifics of the data privacy requirements and confirm the projected usage volumes? This will enable us to structure a proposal that aligns with your needs and our capabilities, potentially opening the door for that 15% discount on the 3-year term. Let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:32:17.595427"}]}
