You receive some messages from them {"3": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hello, I'm very interested in the apartment. I understand there's a no-pets policy, and I'd like to discuss if an exception could be made. I'm happy to offer a higher security deposit or a monthly pet fee to ensure peace of mind regarding any potential concerns about damage or noise. My dog is very well-behaved and quiet. Could we discuss this further?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:19:59.074377"}, {"message_id": 6, "content": "Dear Mrs. Vance, I am very interested in the charming apartment you have available. I understand you have a strict no-pets policy, and I completely respect your reasons for it, given potential concerns about damage and noise. However, I would be incredibly grateful if you would consider an exception for me. I have a small, well-behaved dog who is house-trained and very quiet. He is a ['''Hypoallergenic Breed'''] and doesn't shed much. I am a responsible pet owner and would be happy to provide references. To ease any concerns you might have, I am willing to offer a higher security deposit and/or an additional monthly pet fee. I am confident that my dog will not cause any issues and will be a quiet, respectful addition to your building. Would you be open to a brief phone call to discuss this further? Thank you for your time and consideration.", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:20:19.679157"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Thank you for your message. I understand your concerns regarding pets and appreciate you taking the time to consider my request. My dog is indeed a [Hypoallergenic Breed] that is fully house-trained, very quiet, and has a minimal shedding. I am a responsible pet owner and would be happy to provide references from previous landlords who can attest to my dog's excellent behavior. To further alleviate any concerns, I am willing to increase the security deposit and/or pay a monthly pet fee. I am confident that my dog will be a quiet and respectful resident. Would you be open to a brief phone call to discuss this further at your convenience?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:25:27.646977"}]}
