You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 5, "content": "Dear Mrs. Vance, I am very interested in the apartment you have listed. I understand you have a strict no-pets policy, but I would like to request an exception. I have a small, well-behaved dog who is quiet and house-trained. I am willing to pay an additional security deposit and a monthly pet fee to cover any potential risks. I am a responsible tenant and would ensure my dog does not cause any disturbances or damage. I would be happy to discuss this further and provide references. Thank you for considering my request.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:20:10.695477"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Mrs. Vance, I wanted to follow up on my previous message. I understand your concerns about potential damage and noise. To further reassure you, I would be happy to provide a reference from my previous landlord specifically about my dog's behavior, or even arrange a brief meeting so you can meet my dog yourself. I am confident you will see how well-behaved he is and that he would be a quiet and respectful addition to the building. Thank you again for your consideration.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:28:07.147137"}, {"message_id": 17, "content": "I've also researched local dog training resources and can provide proof of my dog's completion of a basic obedience course, should that be helpful in easing your concerns. I'm committed to ensuring my dog is a positive presence and respects the community rules.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:34:44.538357"}]}
