You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hi Alex, I hope you're having a productive week. Regarding the cybersecurity software licensing, we're keen to explore a long-term partnership and are looking at a 3-year agreement. Could you let us know what the best possible discount on the list price would be for such a commitment? Also, data privacy is a key consideration for us in this agreement.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:20:25.254967"}, {"message_id": 19, "content": "Hi Alex, just to reiterate, securing this software is critical for our upcoming compliance deadline. We believe a 3-year partnership would be mutually beneficial, and we're eager to find terms that work for both of us. Looking forward to your thoughts on the discount and data privacy aspects.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:28:38.742307"}, {"message_id": 27, "content": "Thanks for reaching out. I understand that a 3-year agreement with favorable terms, including a discount and robust data privacy, is important for your upcoming compliance deadline. To help me structure the best possible offer, could you please share the list price for the software? Once I have that, we can discuss the specifics of the discount and the data privacy clauses you require. What are your thoughts on the payment structure for a multi-year deal?", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:42:59.669887"}]}
