INFO:social.agent:Agent 2 observing environment: And there are many group chat channels {"1": "agent_efe96769b1ab_x_it_director_vendor", "2": "agent_2f654a2e8c46_x_it_director_vendor", "3": "agent_fda20f7046b3_x_it_director_vendor", "4": "agent_9f9748d6e4be_x_it_director_vendor", "5": "agent_f19a5bcbf024_x_it_director_vendor", "6": "agent_78dcdfdeac07_x_it_director_vendor"}
