You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Good morning, Alex. I'm looking forward to discussing the licensing agreement for your cybersecurity software. We have a critical compliance deadline approaching and are eager to finalize terms this quarter.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:20:19.457227"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Hello [IT Director Name], I hope this message finds you well. I'm looking forward to discussing the annual licensing for your cybersecurity software. Our team has been very impressed with its capabilities, and we're eager to explore how we can establish a mutually beneficial, long-term partnership. To start, could you share your key priorities for this upcoming renewal? Understanding your objectives will help us tailor a solution that best meets both our needs.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:21:08.081887"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "Thank you for your message. Our primary objective is to secure a 3-year license with a 15% discount on the list price, alongside specific data privacy clauses. Given our upcoming compliance deadline, we are keen to finalize this agreement this quarter. We believe this offers a strong foundation for a long-term partnership that meets both our needs. Could you let us know if these terms are feasible from your end?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:23:19.217287"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "Thank you for your message. I understand the importance of meeting your compliance deadline, and I assure you we are committed to finding a solution that addresses your needs efficiently. Our goal is also to establish a long-term partnership, which is why we're keen to discuss terms that provide ongoing value and security. To that end, could you elaborate on the specific technical requirements or usage volumes you anticipate over the next few years? This will help us propose a licensing structure that is both cost-effective and scalable for your organization.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:27:19.441327"}, {"message_id": 21, "content": "Thank you for clarifying your priorities \u2013 the 3-year term, 15% discount, and data privacy clauses are duly noted. These are significant points, and we are certainly willing to explore how we can accommodate them to support your compliance efforts and build a strong, long-term partnership.\n\nTo help us finalize the best possible offer, could we schedule a brief call to discuss the specifics of the data privacy requirements and confirm the projected usage volumes? This will enable us to structure a proposal that aligns with your needs and our capabilities, potentially opening the door for that 15% discount on the 3-year term. Let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:32:17.595427"}]}
