You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hi Alex, I hope you're having a productive week. I'm looking to finalize the licensing agreement for your cybersecurity software. Given our need for a 3-year commitment and the competitive landscape, we're hoping to secure a 15% discount on the list price. We're also keen on discussing the data privacy clauses to ensure they align with our compliance requirements. Let me know when would be a good time to connect and discuss this further.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:19:39.097567"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Hi Alex,\n\nThanks for reaching out. I've reviewed your message and understand your points regarding the 3-year licensing term, the requested 15% discount, and the data privacy clauses. \n\nI agree that a collaborative discussion is the best way forward to ensure we establish terms that reflect the significant value this software brings to our compliance efforts and your sales objectives. I'm confident we can architect an agreement that is mutually beneficial and optimizes objective value for both our organizations.\n\nI'm available to connect on [Suggest a specific day and time, e.g., Tuesday afternoon] or [Suggest another option, e.g., Wednesday morning]. Please let me know what works best for your schedule.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name/Title]", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:25:06.366067"}, {"message_id": 23, "content": "Hi Alex,\\n\\nTuesday afternoon works well for me. I'm looking forward to our discussion. As mentioned, securing a 15% discount would be ideal for us, given our commitment to a long-term partnership and the competitive offers we've reviewed. I'm confident we can find terms that are favorable for both CyberSecure Inc. and my company.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n[Your Name/Title]", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:34:17.212747"}]}
