You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello. I'm reaching out to discuss the upcoming annual licensing for the cybersecurity software. Given its critical role in our upcoming compliance deadline, we're keen to establish a strong, long-term partnership. Our objective is to secure a 3-year agreement, and we're looking to achieve this with a 15% discount on the list price, along with specific data privacy clauses. I believe by working together, we can find terms that offer optimal value for both our organizations. Would you be open to a brief discussion to explore how we can best align on these objectives?", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:22:18.417513"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Hi Alex, thank you for reaching out. We're very interested in CyberSecure Inc.'s software, especially given its critical role in our upcoming compliance deadline. A 3-year agreement with robust data privacy clauses is indeed our goal. While our target is a 15% discount, we're eager to discuss the terms to find a mutually beneficial arrangement that reflects the value of this partnership. Would you be available for a call sometime this week to delve into the details?", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:26:50.717013"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Hi there, I appreciate your eagerness to partner with CyberSecure Inc. We value your business and recognize the importance of our software for your compliance. Regarding the discount, while 15% is a bit higher than our standard for a new partnership, we are keen to close this deal this quarter. We typically start negotiations around a 5% discount for a 3-year term, but I'm open to discussing this further on a call to see how we can align on terms that are beneficial for both of us. Please let me know your availability.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:32:58.126713"}]}
