You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hello! I'm very interested in the apartment and wanted to discuss the possibility of making it work, even with my small, well-behaved dog. I understand the no-pets policy, but I'm hoping we could explore solutions that would address any concerns you might have. Would you be open to discussing this further?", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:20:50.452334"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Thank you for your message and for considering my inquiry. I completely understand and respect your no-pets policy, especially given past experiences landlords may have had. I want to assure you that my dog is a small, very well-behaved, and quiet companion. He is fully house-trained, has never caused any damage, and is not prone to barking. To further alleviate any concerns, I would be more than happy to offer an additional pet deposit or a small monthly pet fee to cover any unforeseen circumstances. I am also open to discussing this further in person, perhaps even introducing you to my dog so you can see for yourself. I am very keen on renting this charming apartment and am committed to being a responsible and considerate tenant.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:35:56.010614"}, {"message_id": 9, "content": "Thank you for considering my request. I understand that allowing pets can bring up concerns for landlords, and I appreciate you being open to discussing it. To help me understand better, could you share what your biggest worries are regarding pets in the apartment? For example, are you concerned about potential damage, noise, or how it might affect other tenants? Knowing your specific concerns will help me propose solutions that address them directly.", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 07:36:54.892154"}]}
